<section>
  <h2>Guarding for puja days, evenings and overnight shifts</h2>
  <p>Organising a Durga Puja, Kali Puja, Saraswati Puja, Lakshmi Puja or another community or family puja? Request guards or darwan for your pandal, venue entrances and agreed visitor-access duties. Bookings can cover 1, 2, 3, 4 or a few days, including separate shifts where required.</p>
  <p>For committees in Gossainpur, Patharghata, Salbari, Naxalbari, Bagdogra and nearby localities, send the pandal location, busiest visiting hours and committee contact. We will check staffing and travel before confirming availability.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>Agree a clear pandal security brief</h2>
  <ul><li><strong>Entrance and queue coordination:</strong> guide visitors through the entry and exit plan agreed with the organisers.</li><li><strong>Committee and vendor access:</strong> follow agreed arrangements for volunteers, suppliers, performers and maintenance staff.</li><li><strong>Night guarding:</strong> request a separate overnight post and define the handover after public visiting hours.</li><li><strong>Setup and pack-down:</strong> include guarding before opening or after the puja if required, with dates and property responsibility recorded.</li><li><strong>Incident reporting:</strong> agree the committee contact, supervisor escalation and emergency contact procedure.</li></ul>
  <p>Private guards coordinate with the committee and venue. They do not replace police permissions, fire-safety arrangements, electrical checks or the organiser's crowd-safety plan. Discuss public-road and procession requirements with the relevant authorities.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>What your puja committee should send</h2>
  <p>Share the location, number of entrances, expected peak visitor periods, public opening hours, guard dates and any overnight duty. If the programme changes across days, include a day-by-day schedule.</p>
  <p>The quote should state the number of guards per shift, reporting times, supervisor contact, relief arrangements and travel or additional-hours costs. Confirm availability early for busy puja dates.</p>
</section>
